I didn't think you'd make it.

74
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:27,550
Why not?

75
00:03:27,550 --> 00:03:29,340
Well, 'cause you have a steady girlfriend now,

76
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:30,600
and we assumed you'd have to stay home

77
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:33,130
to lower the food down to her in the pit.

78
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:40,680
For your information, Emily is working tonight.

79
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:43,880
Yeah, one would assume, on getting out of the pit.

80
00:03:45,490 --> 00:03:46,800
Okay, let's focus.

81
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,330
The girls are gone, we have 48 hours.

82
00:03:48,330 --> 00:03:49,600
There are no distractions.

83
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,150
Let's change the world.

84
00:03:51,150 --> 00:03:53,120
Thinking caps on. Here we go.

85
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,360
Ooh, this is exciting. We're innovating.

86
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,110
I feel like we're in the Facebook movie.

87
00:03:57,690 --> 00:03:58,790
Oh. I never saw that.

88
00:03:58,790 --> 00:04:00,310
Yeah. Really?

89
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:02,420
It's wonderful, and I swear I'm not saying that

90
00:04:02,420 --> 00:04:04,980
because Justin Timberlake is in it.

91
00:04:06,030 --> 00:04:07,600
Yeah, I have it on Blu-ray.

92
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,260
We should watch it.

93
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:12,100
Cool. I'll make the popcorn.

94
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,530
Guys...

95
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:15,020
