96
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:17,810
"Let's change the world" to "Let's watch TV."

97
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:21,110
I'm sorry. Is that a "no"?

98
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,500
Okay. No. Leonard's right.

99
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:23,600
We're here to focus.

100
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:25,440
Didn't we used to have a list of all our ideas?

101
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:27,210
I-I think I still have it.

102
00:04:27,210 --> 00:04:28,880
I did not get a clear answer.

103
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:30,960
I'm gonna set this down now.

104
00:04:32,030 --> 00:04:33,680
Ah, here it is.

105
00:04:35,370 --> 00:04:37,160
I haven't looked at these in years.

106
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,940
"Robot girlfriend."

107
00:04:38,940 --> 00:04:40,750
Mm, that was mine.

108
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:44,320
"Robot prostitute."

109
00:04:45,250 --> 00:04:47,220
Also mine.

110
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:48,240
Wait. I'm confused.

111
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,960
Why would you need both a robot girlfriend

112
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,730
