235
00:10:13,900 --> 00:10:15,900
I don't think it worked.

236
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:30,840
Maybe after this, you'll be in the mood for some Manilow.

237
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,920
I think after this, I'll be dead.

238
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,540
Look at us out,

239
