240
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,750
I'm proud of her.

241
00:10:39,750 --> 00:10:40,850
This is a great opportunity.

242
00:10:40,850 --> 00:10:42,680
It's nice to see her take it seriously.

243
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,580
It is.

244
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:44,320
But enough about Penny.

245
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:46,330
Let's talk about us.

246
00:10:47,260 --> 00:10:49,030
We're looking good.

247
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,970
We are...

248
00:10:51,370 --> 00:10:52,740
Better than good.

249
00:10:52,740 --> 00:10:55,840
I mean, look at you. Your body's bangin'!

250
00:10:56,710 --> 00:10:57,510
Amy!

251
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,390
Don't "Amy" me.

252
