256
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:11,250
Oh, don't be embarrassed.

257
00:11:11,250 --> 00:11:14,030
I'll show you the divot in my spine.

258
00:11:14,030 --> 00:11:16,530
- What? - No, no, it's okay. I was born with it.

259
00:11:16,530 --> 00:11:18,090
If you put a double-A battery in there,

260
00:11:18,090 --> 00:11:20,260
it makes my leg kick.

261
00:11:23,900 --> 00:11:24,720
All right.

262
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,420
Oh, this is already better.

263
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:28,780
There are far fewer distractions in here.

264
00:11:28,780 --> 00:11:29,810
Plus, this is where our minds

265
00:11:29,810 --> 00:11:31,570
are conditioned to focus on work.

266
00:11:31,570 --> 00:11:33,530
So, I've been thinking about the hover boards,

267
00:11:33,530 --> 00:11:36,130
and maybe there's a way we could use maglev technology.

268
00:11:36,130 --> 00:11:38,930
